2026-10-06T03:58:23.6515132Z Description:
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6517615Z   forge — Mission Control Language runtime
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6518023Z 
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6518291Z Usage:
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6518806Z   forge [command] [options]
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6519131Z 
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6525643Z Options:
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6527457Z   -?, -h, --help  Show help and usage information
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6528184Z   --version       Show version information
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6528405Z 
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6530263Z Commands:
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6531154Z   init <mission>             Resolve expert sources and generate mcl.lock
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6531687Z   run <mission>              Run a mission
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6532741Z   validate <mission>         Validate a mission file and its expert references
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6533224Z   list                       List available resources
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6535098Z   expert                     Manage experts
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6535493Z   registry                   OCI registry operations
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6535940Z   login                      Sign in to Forge (browser) and store a platform key
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6536472Z   whoami                     Show the signed-in Forge user and credit balance
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6536964Z   logout                     Sign out of Forge (remove the stored platform key)
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6537513Z   exec <target> <prompt>     Run a hosted mission once and print the answer
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6538045Z   chat                       Chat with a hosted mission in the current Forge project
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6538499Z   project                    Manage portable Forge projects
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6539115Z   publish <reference> <dir>  Package a mission directory into a self-contained OCI artifact and push it
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6539861Z   clean                      Remove cached OCI experts from ~/.forge/experts
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6540436Z   serve <agent>              Serve a mission as an OpenAI-compatible endpoint
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6540951Z   claude <target>            Launch Claude Code talking to a forge mission
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6541482Z   connect                    Wire an editor's Claude Code extension to a forge mission
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6542613Z   agent                      Manage forge agents running in Docker
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6545892Z   webui                      Manage Open WebUI connected to a forge agent
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6546683Z   provider                   Manage LLM provider profiles
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6547571Z   mcp <mission>              Expose a mission as a stdio MCP server (for Claude Desktop and MCP-aware tools)
2026-10-06T03:58:23.6547969Z 
